{"ticker":"WMB","updated":"2026-10-24T00:28:04Z","profile":{"longName":"The Williams Companies, Inc.","shortName":"Williams Companies, Inc. (The)","sector":"Energy","industry":"Oil & Gas Midstream","country":"United States","website":"https://www.williams.com","fullTimeEmployees":5987,"marketCap":87701102592,"trailingPE":28.565737,"forwardPE":27.163307,"priceToSalesTrailing12Months":7.116863,"pegRatio":2.03,"targetMeanPrice":85.25,"targetHighPrice":103.0,"targetLowPrice":69.0,"numberOfAnalystOpinions":24,"recommendationKey":"strong_buy","revenueGrowth":0.078,"earningsGrowth":0.512,"grossMargins":0.63637,"operatingMargins":0.39540002,"profitMargins":0.24937001,"totalRevenue":12323000320,"beta":0.663,"fiftyTwoWeekHigh":80.08,"fiftyTwoWeekLow":56.19,"currency":"USD","exchange":"NYQ","quoteType":"EQUITY","dividendYield":2.97},"summary":"The Williams Companies, Inc., together with its subsidiaries, operates as an energy infrastructure company primarily in the United States. It operates through Transmission, Power & Gulf, Northeast G&P, West, and Gas & NGL Marketing Services segments. The Transmission, Power & Gulf segment comprises Transco, NWP, and Mountain West interstate natural gas pipelines, and their related natural gas storage facilities, as well as natural gas gathering and processing; and crude oil production handling and transportation assets in the Gulf Coast region. The Northeast G&P segment engages in the midstream gathering, processing, and fractionation activities in the Marcellus Shale region primarily in Pennsylvania and New York, and the Utica Shale region of eastern Ohio. The West segment consists of gas gathering, processing, and treating operations in the Rocky Mountain region of Colorado and Wyoming, the Barnett Shale region of north-central Texas, the Eagle Ford Shale region of South Texas, the Haynesville Shale region of northwest Louisiana, the Mid-Continent region that includes the Anadarko and Permian basins, and the DJ Basin of Colorado; and operates natural gas liquid (NGL) fractionation and storage assets in central Kansas near Conway. The Gas & NGL Marketing Services segment provides wholesale marketing, trading, storage, and transportation of natural gas for natural gas utilities","summary_zh":"威廉斯公司及其子公司主要在美國作為一家能源基礎設施公司運作。該公司透過輸電、電力和海灣、東北 G&P、西部以及天然氣和液化天然氣行銷服務部門開展業務。傳輸、電力和海灣部門包括 Transco、NWP 和 Mountain West 州際天然氣管道及其相關天然氣儲存設施以及天然氣收集和加工；以及墨西哥灣沿岸地區的原油生產處理和運輸資產。 Northeast G&P 部門主要在賓州和紐約州的馬塞勒斯頁岩地區以及俄亥俄州東部的尤蒂卡頁岩地區從事中游收集、加工和分餾活動。西段包括科羅拉多州和懷俄明州落基山地區、德克薩斯州中北部巴尼特頁岩地區、德克薩斯州南部伊格爾福特頁岩地區、路易斯安那州西北部海恩斯維爾頁岩地區、包括阿納達科盆地和二疊紀盆地在內的中大陸地區以及科羅拉多州 DJ 盆地的天然氣收集、加工和處理業務；並在康威附近的NG 中部資產 (LNG) 分經營液化和儲存。天然氣和液化天然氣行銷服務部門為天然氣公用事業公司提供天然氣的批發行銷、貿易、儲存和運輸","sector_zh":"活力","industry_zh":"石油和天然氣中游","candles":[{"t":"2025-08-25","o":56.99,"h":57.53,"l":56.56,"c":56.83,"v":4104600},{"t":"2025-08-26","o":57.01,"h":57.23,"l":56.47,"c":57.13,"v":9560600},{"t":"2025-08-27","o":56.97,"h":57.65,"l":56.9,"c":57.49,"v":5909800},{"t":"2025-08-28","o":57.49,"h":58.09,"l":56.91,"c":58.0,"v":5366600},{"t":"2025-08-29","o":57.97,"h":58.02,"l":57.5,"c":57.88,"v":4093400},{"t":"2025-09-02","o":57.51,"h":57.94,"l":56.79,"c":57.38,"v":7833700},{"t":"2025-09-03","o":57.36,"h":57.99,"l":56.95,"c":57.73,"v":6213300},{"t":"2025-09-04","o":58.0,"h":58.59,"l":57.17,"c":57.58,"v":5554700},{"t":"2025-09-05","o":57.49,"h":57.83,"l":56.09,"c":57.2,"v":8344800},{"t":"2025-09-08","o":57.3,"h":57.68,"l":56.46,"c":56.85,"v":4669300},{"t":"2025-09-09","o":57.19,"h":57.97,"l":56.97,"c":57.57,"v":4490000},{"t":"2025-09-10","o":57.76,"h":59.29,"l":57.75,"c":58.76,"v":5960100},{"t":"2025-09-11","o":58.61,"h":59.35,"l":58.36,"c":59.33,"v":5397600},{"t":"2025-09-12","o":58.85,"h":59.33,"l":58.59,"c":58.81,"v":5630400},{"t":"2025-09-15","o":58.89,"h":59.11,"l":58.4,"c":58.4,"v":3210500},{"t":"2025-09-16","o":58.53,"h":58.63,"l":57.66,"c":57.95,"v":6820100},{"t":"2025-09-17","o":58.06,"h":59.18,"l":58.05,"c":59.02,"v":6084800},{"t":"2025-09-18","o":59.35,"h":60.81,"l":59.18,"c":60.